{
 "uid": "design-check",
 "title": "設計の確認 (exp)",
 "tags": [
  "msa",
  "design-check"
 ],
 "timezone": "browser",
 "schemaVersion": 39,
 "editable": true,
 "refresh": "",
 "time": {
  "from": "now-30m",
  "to": "now"
 },
 "templating": {
  "list": [
   {
    "type": "datasource",
    "name": "ds",
    "label": "データソース",
    "query": "prometheus",
    "current": {}
   },
   {
    "type": "custom",
    "name": "ns",
    "label": "namespace",
    "query": "exp",
    "current": {
     "text": "exp",
     "value": "exp"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
 "panels": [
  {
   "type": "text",
   "title": "",
   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "### 設計の確認 (exp namespace)\n**使い方**: 右上の時間範囲を、確かめたい 1 点の区間に合わせる。`-times.csv` の `prom_from` と `prom_to` (unix 秒) を\n1000 倍して URL に入れると正確に合う: `.../d/design-check?from=<prom_from>000&to=<prom_to>000`\n\n- **① の棒グラフ**は、その区間全体の平均 (区間の終わりの時刻で `rate(...[区間の長さ])`)。区間を `prom_from`〜`prom_to` にすれば、\n  スクリプトが CSV に書いた値 (`usage_mc` など) と同じ計算になる。**ここの問い合わせ文はスクリプトとは別に、人が読める形で書いてある**。\n- **② の台数・HPA、③〜⑤ の折れ線**は、区間の前後を広めに表示して「設計どおりの状態だったか」を目で確かめる用。\n- 記録の細かさ: CPU (cAdvisor) は 10 秒ごと、台数・設定値・Pod の状態 (kube-state-metrics) とノードは 30 秒ごと。\n"
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 6,
    "w": 24,
    "x": 0,
    "y": 0
   },
   "id": 1,
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "${ds}"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "row",
   "title": "① 区間の平均 — CSV と比べる (時間範囲 = prom_from〜prom_to にする)",
   "collapsed": false,
   "panels": [],
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 1,
    "w": 24,
    "x": 0,
    "y": 6
   },
   "id": 2,
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "${ds}"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "bargauge",
   "title": "CPU 使用量 [ミリコア] (Deployment ごとに Pod を合計) ↔ CSV の usage_mc",
   "description": "式: sum by(deploy, container)( rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total[区間の長さ]) ) × 1000。区間の終わりの時刻で評価。k6load (負荷をかける側) の行も出る。CSV の pods 列とも比べられる。",
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "expr": "sum by(deploy, container)(label_replace(rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{namespace=\"$ns\",container!=\"\",container!=\"POD\",pod!~\"promq.*\"}[$__range]), \"deploy\", \"$1\", \"pod\", \"(.+)-[a-f0-9]{6,}-[a-z0-9]+\")) * 1000",
     "instant": true,
     "range": false,
     "legendFormat": "{{deploy}} / {{container}}  使用量 m"
    },
    {
     "refId": "B",
     "expr": "count by(deploy, container)(label_replace(rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{namespace=\"$ns\",container!=\"\",container!=\"POD\",pod!~\"promq.*\"}[$__range]), \"deploy\", \"$1\", \"pod\", \"(.+)-[a-f0-9]{6,}-[a-z0-9]+\"))",
     "instant": true,
     "range": false,
     "legendFormat": "{{deploy}} / {{container}}  Pod 数"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "short",
     "decimals": 1,
     "min": 0,
     "color": {
      "mode": "fixed",
      "fixedColor": "blue"
     }
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {
    "orientation": "horizontal",
    "displayMode": "basic",
    "showUnfilled": true,
    "valueMode": "text",
    "namePlacement": "left",
    "sizing": "auto",
    "reduceOptions": {
     "calcs": [
      "lastNotNull"
     ],
     "values": false,
     "fields": ""
    }
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 11,
    "w": 12,
    "x": 0,
    "y": 7
   },
   "id": 3,
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "${ds}"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "bargauge",
   "title": "絞られた割合 [%] ↔ CSV の throttle_pct (Pod のうち最大)",
   "description": "limits に当たって CPU を止められた周期の割合。5% を超えた行は解析で捨てる設計。",
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "expr": "max by(deploy, container)(label_replace(rate(container_cpu_cfs_throttled_periods_total{namespace=\"$ns\",container!=\"\",container!=\"POD\",pod!~\"promq.*\"}[$__range]) / rate(container_cpu_cfs_periods_total{namespace=\"$ns\",container!=\"\",container!=\"POD\",pod!~\"promq.*\"}[$__range]), \"deploy\", \"$1\", \"pod\", \"(.+)-[a-f0-9]{6,}-[a-z0-9]+\")) * 100",
     "instant": true,
     "range": false,
     "legendFormat": "{{deploy}} / {{container}}  絞り %"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "short",
     "decimals": 1,
     "min": 0,
     "color": {
      "mode": "fixed",
      "fixedColor": "blue"
     }
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {
    "orientation": "horizontal",
    "displayMode": "basic",
    "showUnfilled": true,
    "valueMode": "text",
    "namePlacement": "left",
    "sizing": "auto",
    "reduceOptions": {
     "calcs": [
      "lastNotNull"
     ],
     "values": false,
     "fields": ""
    }
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 11,
    "w": 6,
    "x": 12,
    "y": 7
   },
   "id": 4,
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "${ds}"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "bargauge",
   "title": "ノード ↔ CSV の node_cores / freq_ghz / temp_max_c",
   "description": "",
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "expr": "sum(rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{mode!=\"idle\"}[$__range]))",
     "instant": true,
     "range": false,
     "legendFormat": "ノード CPU [コア]"
    },
    {
     "refId": "B",
     "expr": "avg(avg_over_time(node_cpu_scaling_frequency_hertz[$__range])) / 1e9",
     "instant": true,
     "range": false,
     "legendFormat": "周波数 [GHz]"
    },
    {
     "refId": "C",
     "expr": "max(max_over_time(node_hwmon_temp_celsius[$__range]))",
     "instant": true,
     "range": false,
     "legendFormat": "最高温度 [℃]"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "short",
     "decimals": 2,
     "min": 0,
     "color": {
      "mode": "fixed",
      "fixedColor": "blue"
     }
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {
    "orientation": "horizontal",
    "displayMode": "basic",
    "showUnfilled": true,
    "valueMode": "text",
    "namePlacement": "left",
    "sizing": "auto",
    "reduceOptions": {
     "calcs": [
      "lastNotNull"
     ],
     "values": false,
     "fields": ""
    }
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 11,
    "w": 6,
    "x": 18,
    "y": 7
   },
   "id": 5,
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "${ds}"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "row",
   "title": "② 構成 — 台数・HPA・枠 (設計: 全サービス N 台固定、redis-cart 1 台、HPA 無し)",
   "collapsed": false,
   "panels": [],
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 1,
    "w": 24,
    "x": 0,
    "y": 18
   },
   "id": 6,
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "${ds}"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "timeseries",
   "title": "Deployment の台数 (設定値 spec)",
   "description": "設計どおりなら区間の間ずっと全サービスが同じ台数 (redis-cart だけ 1)。",
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "expr": "kube_deployment_spec_replicas{namespace=\"$ns\"}",
     "legendFormat": "{{deployment}}",
     "range": true
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "short",
     "custom": {
      "lineInterpolation": "stepAfter",
      "showPoints": "never",
      "stacking": {
       "mode": "none"
      }
     }
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {
    "legend": {
     "displayMode": "table",
     "placement": "right",
     "calcs": [
      "lastNotNull",
      "max"
     ]
    },
    "tooltip": {
     "mode": "multi",
     "sort": "desc"
    }
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 8,
    "w": 8,
    "x": 0,
    "y": 19
   },
   "id": 7,
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "${ds}"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "timeseries",
   "title": "動いている Pod 数 (available)",
   "description": "設定の台数と一致していなければ、Pod が立ち上がっていない・落ちている。",
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "expr": "kube_deployment_status_replicas_available{namespace=\"$ns\"}",
     "legendFormat": "{{deployment}}",
     "range": true
